    "- **T vs A:** differences (-1,+1,-1,+1), d = sqrt(4) = 2, Euclidean sim = 1/(1+2) = **0.333**. Both means are 4.5; the centred vectors (-.5,+.5,-.5,+.5) and (+.5,-.5,+.5,-.5) are opposite, so Pearson = **-1**.\n",
